{"name": "PHi: The Broken Strings", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/4a3629620c189acbd62546d3df7371f3.poster.avif?t=1761287961\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/4a3629620c189acbd62546d3df7371f3.webm?t=1761287961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/4a3629620c189acbd62546d3df7371f3.mp4?t=1761287961\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PHi is a 3D puzzle platformer that takes you on an emotional journey through 6 levels, each representing a key life experience. Solve puzzles, explore, and immerse yourself in stunning visuals and a powerful story.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"74\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/baac422ddc9711182af7679b0959aa9c.avif?t=1761287961\" width=\"650\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are lost, with no guide and no clear path ahead. Every step forward is yours to discover,\u00a0every secret corner yours to unveil. The world won\u2019t tell you where to go \u2014 you must find the\u00a0way on your own<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/43151cd6f5e95a1a5e56381ee57807a7.poster.avif?t=1761287961\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/43151cd6f5e95a1a5e56381ee57807a7.webm?t=1761287961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/43151cd6f5e95a1a5e56381ee57807a7.mp4?t=1761287961\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"74\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/322309253f722b1fde874c74c5802a37.avif?t=1761287961\" width=\"650\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage with vast environments where NPCs, secrets, and hidden paths await at every turn. The\u00a0mystery is alive \u2014 the path is yours to unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/29f5c4b6242c202849f2a51ad27c9ac6.poster.avif?t=1761287961\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/29f5c4b6242c202849f2a51ad27c9ac6.webm?t=1761287961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/29f5c4b6242c202849f2a51ad27c9ac6.mp4?t=1761287961\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"74\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/e8481b45786ef65f369e0b6ce2680fe7.avif?t=1761287961\" width=\"650\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve immersive puzzles and unravel mysteries hidden in every corner of the world. Overcome\u00a0obstacles, unlock paths, and embrace the journey ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/44e58059b58dba17d559dfbef71dcbd6.poster.avif?t=1761287961\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/44e58059b58dba17d559dfbef71dcbd6.webm?t=1761287961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/44e58059b58dba17d559dfbef71dcbd6.mp4?t=1761287961\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Play as PHi in a mysterious world, where emotionally charged levels reveal past wounds, restore balance and reignite fading hope.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/6b6abcadc30606da28164371b639ba9b0c5b177d/header.jpg?t=1761287961", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["3D Platformer", "Puzzle Platformer", "Puzzle", "Platformer", "3D", "2.5D"], "developers": "Kyrel", "publishers": "Kyrel", "release_date": "Q1 2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3600240", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "22 October 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/tD18KrHPXFE", "first_seen": 1761091200.0, "review_rank": 1441}